---
// Payroll Taxes Hero with topic background and subtle dark overlay
---

<section id="service-hero" class="relative bg-dark-background py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/pexels/pexels-photo-7111516-1200.jpeg"
      srcset="/assets/images/pexels/pexels-photo-7111516-320.jpeg 320w, /assets/images/pexels/pexels-photo-7111516-640.jpeg 640w, /assets/images/pexels/pexels-photo-7111516-1024.jpeg 1024w, /assets/images/pexels/pexels-photo-7111516-1920.jpeg 1920w"
      sizes="100vw"
      alt="Trust Fund Taxes - Payroll and Sales Tax Issues"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-35"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"

    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/85 via-black/70 to-black/85"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <nav class="text-gray-300 text-[14px] mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
      <a href="/services/audit-help" class="hover:text-white transition">Tax Services</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
      <span class="text-white font-medium">Payroll & Trust Fund Taxes</span>
    </nav>

    <span class="inline-block bg-[#C1272D] text-white font-medium text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-[6px] mb-4">
      Business Taxes
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-[40px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold text-white font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-4 max-w-[950px]">
      Trust Fund Taxes (Payroll & Sales Tax)
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-[22px] text-gray-200 italic max-w-[850px] leading-relaxed">
      Is the IRS trying to collect payroll taxes from your business? Our Utah Business Tax Attorneys can help protect you.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
